data/keep-words.txt is generated by misc/gen-keep-words.py from SCOWL en_US-large
(https://wordlist.aspell.net) and misc/keep-words-written.txt, words counted in FineWeb-2
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-2, ODC-By 1.0).

